  "experimentMessageTimestampsDescription": "Write <t:1700000000> (Discord, with :t :T :d :D :f :F :R styles) or $[1700000000] (Sable) to send a time everyone sees in their own time zone (MSC3160), and show other people's timestamps that way. No restart needed.",
