    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "experimentOfflineSendingDescription": "Messages you send without a connection wait and go out by themselves when you're back online, like Telegram, even if Vommet was closed in between (for up to a week). Files sent offline still need a retry after restarting.",
