    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "experimentManageSpaceRoomsDescription": "Adds \"Manage rooms\" to the space menu for people allowed to edit the space: reorder its rooms and subspaces with drag handles, move a room into another subspace, or remove it from the space (the room isn't deleted). Nothing changes until you save. On phones, long-pressing a room on the space's home page then only opens its menu. No restart needed.",
