  "experimentVoiceRoomChatDescription": "Like Discord: hover a voice room in the room list for a chat button (desktop), or long-press it for \"Open chat\" at the top of the menu (mobile). A voice room's header gets a chat button, and the chat's header a headphones button back to the call. No restart needed.",
