    "type": "text",
    "placeholders": {}
  },
  "experimentSecureSetupDescription": "On for everyone. Right after sign-in, sets up your recovery key (or confirms this device) before any room opens, then checks now and then that you still have the key. Only turn it off to rule it out when something goes wrong; the setup is still in Settings › Security.",
